<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0d0f" />
<title>技术笔记 · <%= p.name %></title>
<meta name="description" content="关于后端工程、系统迁移、实时风控与稳定性治理的技术笔记。" />
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css" /><script src="/js/site.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<header class="detail-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">HX</span><span class="brand-copy"><strong><%= p.name %></strong><small>ENGINEERING NOTES</small></span></a><div class="detail-actions"><a class="button button--ghost" href="/">← 回到主页</a><button class="icon-button" id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="切换明暗主题"><svg class="theme-icon theme-icon--moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.8Z"/></svg><svg class="theme-icon theme-icon--sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.93 19.07l1.42-1.42M17.66 6.34l1.41-1.41"/></svg></button></div></header>
<main class="notes-shell">
  <header class="notes-hero"><div class="card-no">ENGINEERING NOTES / 技术笔记</div><h1>把做过的事，<br><em>沉淀成可以复用的方法。</em></h1><p>记录系统设计、稳定性治理、迁移实践和持续学习。</p></header>
  <% if (notes.length) { %><section class="notes-list"><% notes.forEach((note, index) => { %><a class="note-card" href="/notes/<%= note.slug %>"><span class="note-index">0<%= index + 1 %></span><div><div class="note-tags"><% for (const tag of note.tags) { %><span><%= tag %></span><% } %></div><h2><%= note.title %></h2><p><%= note.summary %></p><small><%= note.publishedAt ? note.publishedAt.slice(0,10) : '' %> · 阅读 <%= note.readCount %></small></div><i>↗</i></a><% }) %></section><% } else { %><div class="notes-empty">笔记正在整理中。</div><% } %>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div><span>© <%= year %> <%= p.footerText %></span><span><%= views %> 次独立访问</span></div><a href="/">BACK HOME ↑</a></footer>
</body></html>
